---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components'
import '@fontsource/inter'
import '../styles/global.css'
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Astro</title>
	</head>
	<body class="max-w-screen-sm mx-auto text-neutral-900 font-[Inter]">

		<nav class="p-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
			<button class="sm:hidden">
				<Icon name={"tabler:menu-2"} />
			</button>
			<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
				<a href="" class="font-bold">Ibrahim Al-Anshor</a>

				<div class="hidden sm:flex sm:gap-4">
					<a href="">Tulisan</a>
					<a href="">Proyek</a>
					<a href="">Tentang</a>
					<a href="">Kontak</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<button>
				<Icon name={"tabler:moon"} />
			</button>
		</nav>

		<div class="px-4 py-8">
			<h1 class="mb-4 font-bold text-3xl flex items-center gap-2">
				<Icon name={"twemoji:waving-hand"} />
				Halo! Saya Ibrahim!
			</h1>

			<p class="mb-4 text-base/7">Saya seorang web developer, biasa menggunakan <code class="bg-neutral-200 font-mono py-0.5 px-1 text-sm rounded">Vue.js</code> dan <code class="bg-neutral-200 font-mono py-0.5 px-1 text-sm rounded">Laravel</code>. Di blog ini saya akan berbagi tulisan seputar coding dan proyek aplikasi yang saya kembangkan.</p>

			<p class="mb-4 text-base/7">Buat kamu yang membutuhkan jasa pembuatan website, aplikasi atau ingin konsultasi, bisa hubungi saya di <a href="ibrahimalanshor6@gmail.com" class="text-sky-700 hover:underline">ibrahimalanshor6@gmail.com</a>, saya siap membantu kamu.</p>

			<p class="mb-4 text-base/7">Kalau kamu butuh mentor untuk belajar coding atau ingin konsultasi seputar coding, bisa juga hubungi saya.</p>

			<h2 class="font-bold text-xl mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
				Hubungi Saya
			</h2>
			
			<div class="flex gap-2 mb-4">
				<a href="" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-blue-600 w-10 h-10 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700">
					<Icon class={"shrink-0 text-white"} size={18} name="tabler:brand-linkedin-filled" />
				</a>
				<a href="" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-indigo-600 w-10 h-10 rounded-md hover:bg-indigo-700">
					<Icon class={"shrink-0 text-white"} size={18} name="tabler:brand-instagram-filled" />
				</a>
				<a href="" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-sky-600 w-10 h-10 rounded-md hover:bg-sky-700">
					<Icon class={"shrink-0 text-white"} size={18} name="tabler:brand-twitter-filled" />
				</a>
				<a href="" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-blue-600 w-10 h-10 rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700">
					<Icon class={"shrink-0 text-white"} size={18} name="tabler:brand-facebook-filled" />
				</a>
				<a href="" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-gray-600 w-10 h-10 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-700">
					<Icon class={"shrink-0 text-white"} size={18} name="tabler:brand-github-filled" />
				</a>
				<a href="" class="flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-red-600 w-10 h-10 rounded-md hover:bg-red-700">
					<Icon class={"shrink-0 text-white"} size={18} name="tabler:brand-youtube-filled" />
				</a>
			</div>

			<h2 class="font-bold text-xl mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
				Jasa Saya
			</h2>

			<ol class="space-y-4">
				<li class="flex items-center justify-between">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-neutral-100 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center">
							<Icon name="twemoji:globe-showing-asia-australia" />
						</div>
						<div>
							<a href="" class="font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Pembuatan Website</a>
							<p class="text-neutral-500 line-clamp-1">Pembuatan website custom apa saja</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<a href="" class="text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-800">
						<Icon name={"tabler:arrow-right"} />
					</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex items-center justify-between">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-neutral-100 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center">
							<Icon name="twemoji:hammer-and-wrench" />
						</div>
						<div>
							<a href="" class="font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Pembuatan REST API</a>
							<p class="text-neutral-500 line-clamp-1">Pembuatan REST API di backend</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<a href="" class="text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-800">
						<Icon name={"tabler:arrow-right"} />
					</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex items-center justify-between">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
						<div class="w-12 h-12 bg-neutral-100 rounded-md flex items-center justify-center">
							<Icon name="twemoji:man-teacher" />
						</div>
						<div>
							<a href="" class="font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Mentoring Coding</a>
							<p class="text-neutral-500 line-clamp-1">Mentor untuk belajar coding</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<a href="" class="text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-800">
						<Icon name={"tabler:arrow-right"} />
					</a>
				</li>
			</ol>

			<h2 class="font-bold text-xl mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
				Tulisan Terbaru
			</h2>

			<ol class="space-y-4 mb-4">
				<li class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-2 items-center">
					<span class="text-neutral-500 text-sm">17 Nov</span>
					<span class="w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-200 rounded-full"></span>
					<span class="text-sm text-neutral-500">nodejs</span>
					<a href="" class="block w-full font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Apa Itu Peer Dependencies di NPM?</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-2 items-center">
					<span class="text-neutral-500 text-sm">9 Nov</span>
					<span class="w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-200 rounded-full"></span>
					<span class="text-sm text-neutral-500">testing</span>
					<a href="" class="block w-full font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Memudahkan Testing Elemen HTML dengan atribut data-testid</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-2 items-center">
					<span class="text-neutral-500 text-sm">28 Okt</span>
					<span class="w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-200 rounded-full"></span>
					<span class="text-sm text-neutral-500">docs</span>
					<a href="" class="block w-full font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Vitepress VS Stralight, Mana yang Lebih Baik untuk Dokumentasi</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-2 items-center">
					<span class="text-neutral-500 text-sm">26 Okt</span>
					<span class="w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-200 rounded-full"></span>
					<span class="text-sm text-neutral-500">javascript</span>
					<a href="" class="block w-full font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Kapan Menggunakan let di Javascript</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-2 items-center">
					<span class="text-neutral-500 text-sm">14 Okt</span>
					<span class="w-1 h-1 bg-neutral-200 rounded-full"></span>
					<span class="text-sm text-neutral-500">mysql</span>
					<a href="" class="block w-full font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Query Rekursi di MySQL</a>
				</li>
			</ol>

			<a href="" class="text-sky-700 hover:underline flex items-center gap-2">
				Lihat Lebih Banyak
				<Icon name={"tabler:arrow-right"} />
			</a>
			
			<h2 class="font-bold text-xl mt-8 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
				Proyek
			</h2>

			<!-- perlu acrd di icon? -->
			<ol class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 mb-4">
				<li class="flex items-center justify-between">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
						<Icon name={"twemoji:clipboard"} size={32} />
						<div>
							<a href="" class="font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Todoin</a>
							<p class="text-neutral-500">Aplikasi todo list</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<a href="">
						<Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-800" />
					</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex items-center justify-between">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
						<Icon name={"twemoji:dollar-banknote"} size={32} />
						<div>
							<a href="" class="font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Catatin</a>
							<p class="text-neutral-500">Aplikasi pencatatan keuangan</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<a href="">
						<Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-800" />
					</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex items-center justify-between">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
						<Icon name={"twemoji:mosque"} size={32} />
						<div>
							<a href="" class="font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Muslim Kit</a>
							<p class="text-neutral-500">Al-Quran, Hadis dan Fatwa Ulama</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<a href="">
						<Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-800" />
					</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex items-center justify-between">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
						<Icon name={"twemoji:flag-saudi-arabia"} size={32} />
						<div>
							<a href="" class="font-medium hover:text-sky-700">Irabin</a>
							<p class="text-neutral-500">Belajar irab dan auto irab</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<a href="">
						<Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-800" />
					</a>
				</li>
				<li class="flex items-center justify-between">
					<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
						<Icon name={"twemoji:desktop-computer"} size={32} />
						<div>
							<a href="" class="font-medium hover:text-sky-700">HTML Playground</a>
							<p class="text-neutral-500">Live online HTML Playground</p>
						</div>
					</div>
					<a href="">
						<Icon name="tabler:arrow-right" class="text-sky-700 hover:text-sky-800" />
					</a>
				</li>
			</ol>

			<a href="" class="text-sky-700 hover:underline flex items-center gap-2">
				Lihat Lebih Banyak
				<Icon name={"tabler:arrow-right"} />
			</a>

			<footer class="mt-8 pt-4 text-center space-y-2 text-neutral-500">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
					<a href="" class="w-10 h-10 bg-neutral-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white">
						<Icon name="tabler:brand-linkedin" />
					</a>
					<a href="" class="w-10 h-10 bg-neutral-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-indigo-600 hover:text-white">
						<Icon name="tabler:brand-instagram" />
					</a>
					<a href="" class="w-10 h-10 bg-neutral-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-sky-600 hover:text-white">
						<Icon name="tabler:brand-twitter" />
					</a>
					<a href="" class="w-10 h-10 bg-neutral-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-blue-600 hover:text-white">
						<Icon name="tabler:brand-facebook" />
					</a>
					<a href="" class="w-10 h-10 bg-neutral-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-gray-600 hover:text-white">
						<Icon name="tabler:brand-github" />
					</a>
					<a href="" class="w-10 h-10 bg-neutral-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 hover:bg-red-600 hover:text-white">
						<Icon name="tabler:brand-youtube" />
					</a>
				</div>
			</footer>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
